{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4EnVReayxojYYzRhy6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient wooden door stands before you, its iron-banded surface weathered by centuries. A single keyhole glows faintly.*\n\nYou insert the key.\n\n*CLUNK.*\n\n*The tumblers turn — one, two, three — each resonating deeper than the last, as if the mechanism extends far beyond the door's physical frame.*\n\n*A seam of golden light splits vertically as the door groans inward, exhaling air that smells of old stone and distant rain.*\n\n*The door is open.*\n\n*Beyond: a corridor lit by no visible source, its walls lined with doors — each one different, each one waiting.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":145,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}